{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のMステ観ていただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンと生ちゃんのピアノ伴奏で君の名は希望の2曲を披露させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このずーが可愛い件。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子にした！気分！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみ、まなとぅ、さゆ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなさん☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"miwaさん、完全に虜になりました☆\n可愛いし歌うますぎる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももクロの百田夏菜子氏とは高校の卒業以来に会ったんだけど\n相変わらず無邪気な娘だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型以外はなにも変わってなかったね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉよかたよかた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベリーショート、ベリーグッド。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日、\nオールライブニッポンで乃木坂はトップバッターでの出演。\nありがたき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のアーティストさんのファンの方もたくさんいるのに、\n乃木坂ファンと同じくらい一緒になって盛り上がってくれたのは本当に嬉しかったです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで10枚目アンダーでの最後の活動だったけど、このメンバーだからこそ乗り越えられたものがたくさんあるとあみは思います！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はバースデーライブ！(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてその後は、\nAKB48さんのリクエストアワーに出演！\nこじ坂46の「風の螺旋」が54位に選んでいただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクアワに出るのは、ちょうど3年前のぐるぐるカーテンのとき以来。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのときはデビューしたてっていうのもあるしAKBさんの舞台に立つということで緊張しすぎてステージ上で歌い終わったあとみんな泣いてた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしいな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例の3年前のリクアワの楽屋で撮ったやつ。七瀬とはこの時から仲良かったけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/24/0886460/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ではこんなに距離が近くなりました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の乃木どこ出るから観てね〜( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばーい！"}],"source":"archive"}